        "details_item": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "details",
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p>A bicarb-free balm made for sensitive skin. Glides on clear, smells beautiful and keeps you fresh all day — lightweight, never sticky, and gentle enough for daily use. 60g.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_EcnQG7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "details",
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "content": "<p>Magnesium to neutralise odour without irritation, shea butter and coconut oil to soothe and glide, arrowroot to keep you dry, candelilla wax to set, and our essential-oil blend for a fresh scent you'll love. No bicarb, no aluminium.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_jGfUNg": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "details",
            "heading": "How to use",
            "content": "<p>Twist up a small amount and swipe onto clean, dry underarms — two swipes each side. Let it absorb for a few seconds, then get dressed. Use again every day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_aFWDkr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "details",
            "heading": "Shipping & returns",
            "content": "<p>Shipping on us for orders over $50. Not for you? Our 30-day happiness guarantee means we'll make it right.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_group": {
          "type": "group",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "good-to-know",
            "heading": "Good to know",
            "open_first": true
          }
        },
        "faq_item": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "good-to-know",
            "heading": "Is it bicarb-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — no bicarb (baking soda) and no aluminium. We use magnesium instead, which neutralises odour without the irritation bicarb can cause on sensitive skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_iDqBUm": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "good-to-know",
            "heading": "Is there an adjustment period?",
            "content": "<p>Some people notice a short transition coming off conventional antiperspirants. It usually settles within a week or two — and you can reapply anytime.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Gi8azK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "good-to-know",
            "heading": "Will it stain in my clothes?",
            "content": "<p>No. It glides on clear and absorbs in seconds, so you can get dressed straight away — no white marks, no residue.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_LTBL7U": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "group_key": "good-to-know",
            "heading": "How long does a tube last?",
            "content": "<p>Around 8–10 weeks with daily use. Pair it with The Companion to get every last bit before you reorder.</p>"
          }
        }
